    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-035-core",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "role": "core",
        "payload": {
          "text": "卡诺图通过合并相邻的 1 来化简逻辑函数。填图和圈组前，先确认两位坐标按格雷码 00、01、11、10 排列；首尾也相邻，斜对角不相邻。"
        },
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "SRC-C03",
            "versionId": "VER-SRC-C03-8bd0e5dc8fe3",
            "pdfPages": [
              7
            ],
            "visualStatus": "verified",
            "note": "格雷排列、跨边相邻、重复圈组与四角合并原页"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-035-prerequisite",
        "kind": "knowledge-reference",
        "role": "core",
        "payload": {
          "targetUnitId": "KU-034",
          "intent": "回看坐标排列、最小项位置和相邻规则"
        },
        "sourceRefs": []
      },
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-035-diagram",
        "kind": "interactive",
        "role": "core",
        "payload": {
          "component": "kmap",
          "config": {
            "variables": [
              "A",
              "B",
              "C"
            ],
            "columnOrder": [
              "00",
              "01",
              "11",
              "10"
            ],
            "cells": [
              [
                1,
                0,
                0,
                1
              ],
              [
                1,
                0,
                0,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "highlight": "wrap-four"
          },
          "inputs": {
            "showCorners": false
          },
          "bindings": {
            "figure": "cells",
            "controls": "showCorners",
            "output": "highlight"
          }
        },
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "SRC-C03",
            "versionId": "VER-SRC-C03-8bd0e5dc8fe3",
            "pdfPages": [
              7
            ],
            "visualStatus": "verified",
            "note": "格雷排列、跨边相邻、重复圈组与四角合并原页"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-035-steps",
        "kind": "steps",
        "role": "core",
        "payload": {
          "items": [
            "按真值表或最小项编号把 0、1 填入对应格。",
            "把相邻的 1 圈成含 2^k 格的矩形；圈组可跨边界、可重叠，但不能含 0。",
            "检查每个 1 至少被一个圈覆盖；圈越大，消去的变量越多。",
            "每圈只保留取值不变的变量，消去发生变化的变量，再把各圈得到的与项相或。"
          ]
        },
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "SRC-C03",
            "versionId": "VER-SRC-C03-8bd0e5dc8fe3",
            "pdfPages": [
              7
            ],
            "visualStatus": "verified",
            "note": "格雷排列、跨边相邻、重复圈组与四角合并原页"
          },
          {
            "sourceId": "SRC-C03",
            "versionId": "VER-SRC-C03-8bd0e5dc8fe3",
            "pdfPages": [
              14
            ],
            "visualStatus": "verified",
            "note": "质蕴含、必要质蕴含与覆盖流程原页"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-035-warning",
        "kind": "callout",
        "role": "core",
        "payload": {
          "tone": "amber",
          "text": "不能只按‘先圈最大的圈’贪心。先找出所有质蕴含；若某个 1 只被一个质蕴含覆盖，该圈就是必要质蕴含，必须保留。先选必要质蕴含，再用尽量简洁的组合覆盖剩余的 1。"
        },
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "SRC-C03",
            "versionId": "VER-SRC-C03-8bd0e5dc8fe3",
            "pdfPages": [
              14
            ],
            "visualStatus": "verified",
            "note": "质蕴含、必要质蕴含与覆盖流程原页"
          }
        ]
      },
